  "title": "France bans social media access for children under 15",
  "summary": "France has passed a law banning social media access for under-15s, making it the first EU country to implement such a ban. The law, which will start in September, aims to address concerns about cyberbullying, social media addiction, and youth risks, and will also require platforms to verify users' age.",
